// Reference file for personal signing settings.
//
// Usage: copy this file to Developer.xcconfig (same directory) and fill in
// your Apple Developer team ID. Developer.xcconfig is gitignored and is
// attached as the base configuration of every build configuration in
// iosApp.xcodeproj, so the team ID never ends up in version control.
//
// With CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic (set in the Xcode project) this is all
// you need to run the demo on your own devices.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID_HERE
